<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CommitMate | 완벽한 행동 설계</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #030303;
            --primary: #ffffff;
            --accent: #6366f1;
            --danger: #ff4d4d;
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --text-muted: #8a8a8a;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg); color: #fff; overflow-x: hidden; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }

        /* [Background] 그라데이션 광원 */
        .spotlight {
            position: absolute; top: -20%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 100vw; height: 80vh;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
            z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* [Header] */
        header {
            height: 70px; display: flex; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky; top: 0; background: rgba(3, 3, 3, 0.8); backdrop-filter: blur(15px); z-index: 100;
        }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; }
        .header-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .logo { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; }

        /* [Navigation] */
        nav { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-link { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; transition: 0.3s; }
        .nav-link:hover { color: #fff; }

        /* [Sign Up Button - Option 2: Neon Breathing] */
        .btn-signup-sm {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--accent);
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .btn-signup-sm:hover {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.45);
            transform: scale(1.05); /* 약간 커지는 효과 추가 */
        }

        /* [Hero Section] */
        .hero { padding: 100px 0 60px; text-align: center; }
        .hero-badge {
            background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 100px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px); font-weight: 850; line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -3px;
        }
        .hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
        .hero p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 19px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 50px; line-height: 1.6; }

        /* [Dashboard Mockup] */
        .dashboard-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px; gap: 20px;
            max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;
            position: relative;
        }

        .main-card {
            background: #0a0a0a; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }

        .side-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
        .glass-panel {
            background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 20px; border-radius: 20px; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .task-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; padding: 18px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .check-box { width: 22px; height: 22px; border: 2px solid #222; border-radius: 6px; }
        .task-item.completed .check-box { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); position: relative; }
        .task-item.completed .check-box::after { content: '✓'; font-size: 14px; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: -2px; }
        .task-item.completed .text { color: #444; text-decoration: line-through; }

        .penalty-bar {
            height: 6px; background: #222; border-radius: 10px; margin: 12px 0; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .penalty-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--danger); width: 65%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--danger); }

        .feed-item { font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; gap: 10px; }
        .avatar { width: 18px; height: 18px; background: #333; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

        .btn-cta {
            background: #fff; color: #000; padding: 18px 44px; border-radius: 16px;
            font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

        footer { padding: 80px 0; text-align: center; color: #333; font-size: 13px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="spotlight"></div>

<header>
    <div class="container header-inner">
        <div class="logo">CommitMate.</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#" class="nav-link">사용법</a>
            <a href="#" class="nav-link">커뮤니티</a>
            <a href="/login-form" class="nav-link" style="margin-left: 10px;">로그인</a>
            <a href="signup-form" class="btn-signup-sm">회원가입</a>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-badge">현재 2,491개의 팀이 목표를 지키고 있습니다</div>
        <h1>의지가 흔들린다면<br><span>지갑</span>을 거세요.</h1>
        <p>투명한 장부 관리, 자동 벌금 정산, 강력한 커뮤니티.<br>당신의 꾸준함을 시스템으로 완성합니다.</p>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 70px;">
            <a href="signup-form" class="btn-cta">지금 무료로 시작하기</a>
        </div>

        <!-- [Dashboard Mockup] -->
        <div class="dashboard-grid">
            <div class="main-card">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                    <div>
                        <h3 style="font-size: 24px;">오늘의 미션</h3>
                        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px;">2026년 5월 11일 월요일</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align: right;">
                        <span style="color: var(--danger); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;">마감까지 02:41:09</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="task-list">
                    <div class="task-item completed">
                        <div class="check-box"></div>
                        <div class="text">아침 7시 기상 및 오운완 인증</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="check-box"></div>
                        <div class="text">기술 블로그 포스팅 1개 업로드</div>
                        <span style="margin-left: auto; color: var(--danger); font-size: 11px;">벌금 ₩5,000</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="check-box"></div>
                        <div class="text">리액트 공식 문서 3챕터 정독</div>
                        <span style="margin-left: auto; color: var(--danger); font-size: 11px;">벌금 ₩3,000</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="side-card">
                <div class="glass-panel">
                    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600;">나의 위기 지수</p>
                    <h4 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 5px 0;">₩ 8,000 <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--danger);">위험</span></h4>
                    <div class="penalty-bar"><div class="penalty-fill"></div></div>
                    <p style="font-size: 11px; color: #555;">어제보다 미완수 확률이 12% 높습니다.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-panel" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 15px;">팀 활동 실시간 피드</p>
                    <div class="feed-item">
                        <div class="avatar" style="background: #4ade80;"></div>
                        <span><b>김민수</b>님이 미션을 완료했습니다.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feed-item">
                        <div class="avatar" style="background: var(--danger);"></div>
                        <span><b>이영희</b>님이 벌금 ₩5,000 적립..</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feed-item">
                        <div class="avatar" style="background: #60a5fa;"></div>
                        <span><b>박준형</b>님이 인증샷을 공유했습니다.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>COMMITMATE — NO MORE EXCUSES. JUST RESULTS.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>